WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.980
Hello, I'm Vladyslav Konrad,

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.070
a student at American University Kyiv,

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.930
and I'm creating FearlessU to help people
manage their fears and psychological problems.

4
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:15.070
FearlessU is an application
which uses advanced AI

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.240
to create new CBT techniques
in the future,

6
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.500
proven by cognitive behavioral therapy,

7
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.200
created by Aaron Beck.

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.930
And my idea is to help people
with their psychological state,

9
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.810
especially in Ukraine or other countries

10
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.270
where there is a war,

11
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.980
and people who suffered because of trauma

12
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.100
or shelling or shooting.

13
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.270
And this application will use AI,

14
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:47.590
and it will help them manage their fears.

15
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.490
This is my main idea:

16
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.850
to help people and be fearless.

17
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.300
FearlessU. Beyond fear. Beyond limits.
